message: "If you use GeoSpark or GeoSpark Bench, please cite:"
title: "GeoSpark: Ground-Truth Spatial Tool Augmentation for Large Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghasemi Tootkaboni"
    given-names: "Mazdak"
